## Design 5: Devices Management Page

### Original Prompt

Devices management page with sidebar navigation. Top navbar with search and filters. Main content showing network device inventory with device grid cards and detailed table. Cards show device name, IP, type, status, last seen, with action buttons. Filter options by type (PLC, HMI, Switch, Gateway, Engineering), status (Online, Offline, Unknown), vulnerability level (Critical, High, Medium, Low). Matches Astrics dashboard aesthetic with #F28C28 orange and #2E1A47 purple accents. Classic SaaS style, Satoshi font, light backgrounds #f5f5f5, subtle borders #e0e0e0. Left sidebar with navigation menu. Top header with logo, nav links, search, notifications, user menu. Main content with page title, filter controls, and device inventory displayed as cards in grid view and detailed table view toggle.

