## Design 6: Threat Management

### Original Prompt

Threat management page with navbar, left sidebar, and main content area. Top header shows threat metrics: Critical (3), High (5), Medium (4), Resolved Today (7). Severity-colored threat cards arranged in list: critical cards have red left border (#e74c3c), high orange (#f39c12), medium yellow (#eab308). Each card shows: severity badge, threat name, affected devices count, attack timeline progress, recommended actions with priority levels (1-3), automated response status icons. Right sidebar includes: Attack Timeline with event progression, Recommended Actions prioritized list with Execute/Schedule/Plan buttons, Automated Actions Status tracking. Tables with clean borders, hover effects. GitHub/Stripe 2012-2015 aesthetic: Satoshi font, #F28C28 orange primary, #2E1A47 purple secondary, light gray #f5f5f5 background, subtle #e0e0e0 borders. No gradients, flat design, professional typography.

