## Design 7: Settings Page

### Original Prompt

Settings page with tabbed interface: Account Settings, Team Management, Integrations, API Keys, Notifications. Tabs show profile form (name, email, password change), team members list with roles and removal options, integration toggles (Slack, PagerDuty, webhook), API key generation and management with copy/revoke buttons, email notification preferences and alert frequency. Consistent with Astrics classic SaaS aesthetic - top navbar with logo and user menu, left sidebar navigation, clean card-based layout, Satoshi font, #F28C28 orange and #2E1A47 purple accents, light gray backgrounds #f5f5f5, subtle borders #e0e0e0. Professional flat design with no gradients. Ruby on Rails ready HTML.

